# Test, lint and security tooling. Deliberately kept out of
# lambda/requirements.in so none of it ships in the Lambda dependency layer,
# which has a hard 262144000 byte unzipped limit.
#
# pytest/pytest-cov/pytest-env/pytest-mock drive `make test`; bandit drives
# `make bandit`, which `make fmt` and `make lint` depend on.
